Invisible Frames for Sunrise (version 0.5.0)

A port of Invisible Frames 2.0.1 by Roundaround.
Original source: https://github.com/Roundaround/mc-fabric-invisible-frames
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Minecraft 26.3 by lavoide, and to Sunrise by arismoko: the rules are re-implemented in
Rust on Sunrise's mod API (no Java code is included); the icon is the original's. This port is
distributed under the same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE.
